## Architecture Diagram (VocaFlash - April 2026)

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Frontend (Pages)"
        Landing[LandingPage]
        Dashboard[DashboardPage]
        Mastery[MasteryPage]
        Library[LibraryPage]
        Study[StudyPage]
        RoadmapTopics[RoadmapTopicsPage]
        Admin[Admin Pages]
    end

    subgraph "Logic Layer (Hooks)"
        HookMastery[useMasteryWords]
        HookRoadmap[useRoadmapTopics]
        HookAuth[useAuth]
        HookStreak[useStreak]
    end

    subgraph "Core Lib (SRS & Storage)"
        SRS[srs.ts - FSRS v5]
        Supabase[Supabase Client]
        MasteryLib[storage/mastery.ts]
        I18n[i18n-utils.ts]
    end

    subgraph "External"
        SupabaseCloud[Supabase Cloud DB]
    end

    Mastery --> HookMastery
    HookMastery --> MasteryLib
    MasteryLib --> Supabase
    Supabase --> SupabaseCloud
    
    RoadmapTopics --> HookRoadmap
    HookRoadmap --> MasteryLib
    
    Study --> SRS
    Library --> MasteryLib
    
    Admin --> I18n
    Admin --> Supabase
```